From fbfeedb77763c08694b770fadf1541ba16942522 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mminin <mminin2010@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XFA: Let viewers answer the questions of scripts

Message boxes asking Yes or No, such as "Do you want to clear all data
on this form?", were answered Yes before the user saw them. Viewers can
now answer them, and the prompts of xfa.host.response(), while scripts
wait, with poppler_document_xfa_set_dialog_funcs(). Without these
functions questions are answered as before.

app.alert() and app.response() also take their arguments as one object.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
